"""Tool registry and executor for agentic tool calling.

Tools are exposed to the LLM as callable functions. The agent can invoke them
during a multi-turn tool-call loop before producing its final response.

Supported by both providers:
  * Ollama  — /api/chat with ``tools`` field (llama3.2, mistral, etc.)
  * OpenAI  — chat.completions.create() with ``tools`` field
"""

